import json
from gbnf import GBNF
grammars=['root ::= \"foo\"','root ::= [a-z]+ | \"x\"','root ::= (\"a\" \"b\")+ \"c\"']
out=[]
for g in grammars:
    s=GBNF(g)
    out.append({'g':g,'plain':s.graph.print(s.pointers,False),'colored':s.graph.print(s.pointers,True)})
ts=json.load(open('/tmp/parity/ts_print.json'))
print('MATCH' if out==ts else 'MISMATCH')
if out!=ts:
    for a,b in zip(out,ts):
        if a!=b: print(repr(a)); print(repr(b))
"
